        "all": "Heart-rate and steps permission are denied, so the wrist holds no samples: no event carries a summary field, the session end carries no heart-rate pair and no set blocks, and the phone holds no sensor summary. e-r2 still carries pausedMs 120000, because the pause is the round timer's, not a sensor's.",
